OL,3,GNEWSALarge blaze tears through 18th
OL,4,ACentury building
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have spent hours tackling
OL,7,Fa blaze at an unoccupied 18th Century
OL,8,Fbuilding close to a church.
OL,10,FBuckinghamshire Fire and Rescue crews
OL,11,Fwere called to The Bury in Church
OL,12,FStreet, Chesham, at 03:30 BST.
OL,14,FThe service said the fire was producing
OL,15,Fa large amount of smoke, and asked
OL,16,Fpeople to avoid the area and keep
OL,17,Fwindows and doors closed.
